      {
        "id": 79701,
        "name": "jffdougan",
        "username": "jffdougan",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/{size}/1882_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-31T02:03:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Paul\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/48/5862_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Paul:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We went ahead and changed those cards in the latest print run to make them more clear.&nbsp;We ordered a bunch of extra copies of the cards that changes from the manufacturer, and as soon as we have them at our warehouse, we'll be putting complete sets of them on the web store for $0.01 and with a weight of 0.01lbs. It will still charge you shipping, but that is all, and if you combine it with any other order it will be essentially free.The only reason this came up before we could make an announcement is because we emergency shipped 12 copies from the latest print run to Leisure Games direct from China so that they would have them during our visit. Those are the only 12 from that print run that have been sold to date :)Unfortunately, Divine Focus was overlooked when we made this change. It should also have been altered. Consider it errata'd to work the same way as the other cards, and we'll change it in the next print run (and also make corrected copies available in the same way).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'll second the question about whether we can order these and specify that it get added to Vengeance when it ships. Ditto with an extra set of round (HP) counters.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:01:33.584Z",
