        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-31T02:39:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's interesting to note how this ruling changes the battle against Advanced Warlord Voss.&nbsp; Since his starting side reduces damage dealt \"by hero targets\" rather than \"to villain targets\", under the old ruling, it instantly negated this entire class of cards (\"No <span class=\"bbcode-s\">soup</span> Solar Flare for you!\").&nbsp; They are now usable in that match again, so Voss takes a tiny downtick in difficulty as a result.</p>",
