        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-01T04:27:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pydro\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/48/1844_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pydro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So, we can just add these to Vengeance? Or will that happen automatically?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm quite curious about this myself.&nbsp; I'll gladly pay a penny (or even 100 times that with a whole dollar) to have updated cards come with my Vengeance or GSF shipment.</p>",
