        "created_at": "2013-11-04T16:27:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Looking at the barcode on the front of the box it says second printing, but unless you bought the game from Leisure Games on or after the UK day you definitely do not have the same print run as I have. &gt;G specifically emergency shipped 12 copies from China to the UK for the day. I do not believe that the copies at Essen were from that print run either&nbsp;<span>(though that is speculation on my part to do with shipping stuff from both the US and China to Essen being prohibitively expensive, I could be wrong)</span><span>.</span></p>",
