        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Paul\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/48/5862_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Paul:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The only 12 games that have ever been available for sale to date with the new wording were shipped to Leisure Games. If you did not ultimately get your copy of Enhanced Edition from Leisure Games in the past two weeks, you do not have the new wording on your cards.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>got it. Thanks!</p>\n<p>(If I tried to place the order now-ish, would it be possible to have the cards shipped with Vengeance?)</p>",
