        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-13T14:44:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I believe Amazon is not currently Rule 15 compliant.</p><p>Their purchase info should read: \"If 39.99 plus shipping is paid, receive one Copy of Sentinels of the Multiverse Enhanced Edition.\"</p><p>I checked their erata, but it didn't say anything, so I don't think they are up on their current rulings. &nbsp;I E-Mailed their IT department with a link to Spiff's PDF, hopefully they update in time for the combined Rook City/Infernal Relics realease.</p>",
