      {
        "id": 79715,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-13T16:46:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For a while you are not going to know what you're getting until you open the box (unless you buy direct from &gt;G), there are going to be both errataed and unerrataed copies floating in the supply chain, that's just the nature of the distribution chain. There's no scenario where a mass recall is an improvement for Sentinels (or &gt;G) over just letting the&nbsp;<span>unerrataed&nbsp;</span><span>copies sell out first.</span></p>",
